Roxanne II decrypting centre
Message 21088
For % &
                            General Alex Kolman
                            Saint Georges Base
                            Mount Phoenix

As we say in Lenda "Nikate oda Shintawa" which means
"Glory to you Commander".

But all this is just a beginning, you must go as quickly as
possible to the Sekuomi base, develop the site and launch
an attack against the enemy in the North West. Do not
take any risks, wait untill your ally from the North has
launched his offensive and back him up in his attack.

The enemy is isolated from their partner who is situated on
an island in the South, which will make shared actions
difficult.

Meditate on this Lenda saying : "Hokiteshi niwa sukite,
sono sake toshite", which you will have understood means :
"When the well water is frozen, drink hot wine".